    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have died, and have gone to hell. Visit different creatures and answer their questions about yourself. Proceed to the death himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a walking simulator about answering questions about your own life. Were you loved? What was the meaning of your life? The game is very bleak with visuals and audio that shows the main character's inner world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to come home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark art style using voxel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing and creepy soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short length</p></li></ul>",
